OL,3,AAfrican writing award probe finds 'no
OL,4,Aevidence' winning story was AI
OL,5,Agenerated
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Caine Prize for African Writing has
OL,8,Fsaid that after an internal review it
OL,9,Fhas found no evidence that Zimbabwean
OL,10,Fwriter Simbarashe Kundizeza had used
OL,11,Fgenerative AI to write his winning
OL,12,Fshort story and confirmed him as the
OL,13,Fwinner of this year's #10,000 ($13,000)
OL,14,Faward.
OL,16,FEllah Wakatama, chair of the Caine
OL,17,FPrize's board of trustees, said the
OL,18,Fmatter had been investigated following
OL,19,Fan article in US magazine The Atlantic
OL,20,Fwith the headline, Yet Another Literary
OL,21,FPrizewinner Seems to Be AI.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,169,160,200,105,0,100
