OL,3,AAfrican writing award probe finds 'no
OL,4,Aevidence' winning story was AI
OL,5,Agenerated
OL,6,
OL,7,F"From our detailed investigation, we
OL,8,Ffeel the evidence is clear: The Blue
OL,9,FFighter was human written," she said in
OL,10,Fa video posted on X.
OL,12,FThe accusation had caused a social
OL,13,Fmedia uproar and Kundizeza had denied
OL,14,Fthe allegation.
